    "answer": "mercilessly/relentlessly/unsparingly",
    "mnemonic": "Remember how <ja>容赦</ja> can mean \"forgiveness\" and \"mercy?\" Well add <ja>なく</ja> (basically making it NOT that), and it becomes <vocabulary>relentlessly</vocabulary> and <vocabulary>mercilessly</vocabulary>. The exact opposite of what it was before!",
